     A* Conditioning: And/Or lines, INDARA, SETOF and CHANGE
     A                                      INDARA RSTDSP
     A                                      VLDCMDKEY(99 'Key pressed')
     A                                      CA03(03)
     A          R HEADER                    SETOF(40 'Reset') CHANGE(41)
     A                                  1 30'Order entry'
     A  20N21                           3  2'Rush order'
     AA 22                                  DSPATR(BL)
     A  30
     AO 31                                  COLOR(PNK)
     A            ORDNO          7S 0B  5 15
     A  50                                  DSPATR(PR)
     A N50                                  DSPATR(HI)
     A                                  5  2'Order  . :'
     A            QTY            5Y 0B  6 15
     A  60                                  ERRMSG('Quantity is not valid' 60)
     A                                  6  2'Quantity :'
     A          R FOOTER                    OVERLAY CLRL(*NO)
     A  90                                  PROTECT
     A                                 23  2'F3=Exit'
